# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Expands the gate into its *definition*: the [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") of the reference followed by the full [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"). This is equivalent to the gate as an *operator*, for any input state.\n"
msgstr "ขยาย Gate เป็น*นิยาม*ของมัน: [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") ของ reference ตามด้วย [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") เต็มรูปแบบ ซึ่งเทียบเท่ากับ Gate ในฐานะ*ตัวดำเนินการ* สำหรับสถานะอินพุตใด ๆ\n"

